### E-Commerce Inventory & Order API - Week 2 Collection
### Test with VS Code REST Client extension or import into Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### =======================================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### =======================================================

### Check API Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### =======================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & AUTHORIZATION (TASK 2.1)
### =======================================================

### 2.1 Register New User
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "username": "adalove_test",
  "email": "ada_test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.2 Login User & Get JWT
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store token dynamically from login response:
@token = {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

### 2.3 Get Current User Profile (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.4 Test 401 Unauthorized (No Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### =======================================================
### 3. PRODUCTS (CATALOG MANAGEMENT)
### =======================================================

### 3.1 List All Products (Public, Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=10

### 3.2 Get Single Product by ID (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 3.3 Create Product (Protected: Requires Bearer Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard RGB",
  "description": "Hot-swappable 75% mechanical keyboard with PBT keycaps",
  "price": 99.99,
  "stock": 30
}

### 3.4 Update Product (Protected: Requires Bearer Token)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 84.99,
  "stock": 28
}

### 3.5 Delete Product (Protected: Requires Bearer Token)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =======================================================
### 4. RELATIONSHIPS & ORDERS (TASK 2.2)
### =======================================================

### 4.1 Place Order (Deducts Stock & Calculates Total)
# @name placeOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Store order ID dynamically:
@orderId = {{placeOrder.response.body.data.id}}

### 4.2 Test 400 Insufficient Stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 9999
}

### 4.3 Get Authenticated User's Orders (1:N Relationship)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/my-orders?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4.4 Get Single Order Details (Ownership Check)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4.5 Update Order Status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "shipped"
}

### 4.6 Cancel Order (Restores Stock back to Product)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
